      "writtenOn": "2023-12-03T10:09:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please also document the threading / synchronization model of this class. For example, whether if\u0027s thread-safe to call any of its public methods from any thread; And / or how are the member fields are protected, so what should new developers do to add more fields.\n\nYour current code is not thread-safe, some of the code uses `mHandler` to synchronize, while others use `synchronized` keyword. I suggest simply always use `synchronized` given this class does no async operations.",
