      "writtenOn": "2023-12-03T10:09:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To add system properties support for country code, you need to define sepolicy contexts for the system properties and define system properties as APIs, see https://source.android.com/docs/core/architecture/configuration/add-system-properties and https://source.android.com/docs/core/architecture/configuration/sysprops-apis.\n\nI believe we don\u0027t want to support system properties if we already plan to support Resource Overlay. Generally, don\u0027t use system properties if there are other ways to support vendor customization / configuration. See https://source.android.com/docs/core/architecture/configuration#system-properties for cons of system properties.\n\nSo please remove system properties support from this CL.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 75,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 76,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "d5bfaf75f8ac3d0df31d026773d9a02bc18e4101",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
