        "id": 1837411
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-12-11T05:00:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Changing the overlay configuration requires to change the source code. When the factory produces the same product for different countries, we need to provide different images for different countries if we are using the overlay to configure country code. If we are using the system property, the factory only needs to provision different country codes via the system property for different country products.",
      "parentUuid": "105bcfc4_88214283",
